popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0003620000</span>3,620<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Sane_Asylum\" title=\"The Sane Asylum\">The Sane Asylum</a></b>, end chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Exceptional Charisma +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Exceptional Charisma +1</a></b>: This item makes the wearer have more flair, granting a +1 <a href=\"/page/Exceptional_bonus\" title=\"Exceptional bonus\">Exceptional bonus</a> to Charisma.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Summon_Xoriat_Horror\" title=\"Summon Xoriat Horror\">Summon Xoriat Horror</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Summon_Xoriat_Horror\" title=\"Summon Xoriat Horror\">Summon Xoriat Horror</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 20<br /><b>Charges: </b>3 (3/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 3 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:3)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Enchantment Focus +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Enchantment Focus +2</a>:</b> +2 Equipment bonus to the DC of Enchantment spells.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Shard_of_Xoriat.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Shard_of_Xoriat.png/420px-Shard_of_Xoriat.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"511\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Shard_of_Xoriat.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A crystalline fragment of some Xoriat mineral. The magic it is enchanted with will make the wearer a more charismatic leader, and even grants the service of several Xoriat creatures each day.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>The monsters summoned by this item are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Chaos_Beholder\" title=\"Chaos Beholder\">Chaos Beholder</a>, CR16</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Greater_Evil_Eye\" title=\"Greater Evil Eye\">Greater Evil Eye</a>, CR15</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Mind_Flayer_Mage\" title=\"Mind Flayer Mage\">Mind Flayer Mage</a>, CR16</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Taken\" title=\"Taken\">Taken</a>, CR13</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Xorian_Render\" title=\"Xorian Render\">Xorian Render</a>, CR15 (Flesh Render)</li></ul>\n<p><br />\nNotes:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Early version of this item was not <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">exclusive</a>. Even if you have the old non-exclusive version in your inventory, you cannot loot a new one.</li>\n<li>Using the clicky in public area displays the summoning animation and consumes a charge from the item without any effect.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817223202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3104/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20615/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6125/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n126.50%  151.276     40 Template:IO\n100.00%  119.590      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  119.590      1 -total\n 95.40%  114.088      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 42.91%   51.318      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 42.17%   50.427      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 40.91%   48.922      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 39.81%   47.613      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.09%   27.610      5 Template:Popup\n 16.82%   20.109      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:16455-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817223202 and revision id 634625. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Jewelry\n  | name                     = Shard of Xoriat\n  | minlevel                 = 15\n  | type                     = Trinket\n  | slot                     = Trinket\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtA|BoA|1}}\n  | durability               = 70\n  | material                 = Gem\n  | hardness                 = 8\n  | basevalue                = 3,620pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | quest                    = The Sane Asylum\n  | chest                    = end chest\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Stat|CHA|1|Exceptional}}\n* {{clicky|Summon Xoriat Horror|20|3}}\n* {{Spell Focus|Enchantment|2}}\n  | description              = A crystalline fragment of some Xoriat mineral. The magic it is enchanted with will make the wearer a more charismatic leader, and even grants the service of several Xoriat creatures each day.\n  | pic                      = Disc Generic Purple.png\n  | picdesc                  = Shard of Xoriat.png\n  | tips                     = The monsters summoned by this item are:\n* [[Chaos Beholder]], CR16\n* [[Greater Evil Eye]], CR15\n* [[Mind Flayer Mage]], CR16\n* [[Taken]], CR13\n* [[Xorian Render]], CR15 (Flesh Render)\n<!--Note: Spell Absorption like that from [[Mantle of the Worldshaper]] will block the summoning\n* This bug has been fixed* -->\n<br />\nNotes:\n* Early version of this item was not [[exclusive]]. Even if you have the old non-exclusive version in your inventory, you cannot loot a new one.\n* Using the clicky in public area displays the summoning animation and consumes a charge from the item without any effect.\n}}\n[[Category:Summons]]\n[[C:Eleven Year Old Cake items]]",
